<title>NETHERLANDS: BAM LOSS IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</title>
<headline>BAM LOSS IN LINE WITH FORECAST.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-04-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Yr to Dec 31, 1996</p>
<p>(in millions of guilders unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Net loss per shr (guilders)	4.02 vs  10.45 profit</p>
<p>    Net loss				 7.8  vs  20.0 profit</p>
<p>    Dividend (guilders)		  5.25 vs   5.25</p>
<p>    Turnover (billion)		   1.61 vs   1.62</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    26.7  vs  30.0</p>
<p>    Tax				     11.8  vs  10.8</p>
<p>    Net extraordinary charges	 25.2  vs   nil</p>
<p>NOTE - Builder Koninklijke BAM Groep NV said in February it</p>
<p>expected a 1996 loss of about eight million guilders.</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom +31 20 504 5000, Fax +31 20 504 5040</p>
</text>
